---
// Reviews.astro
---
<section id="reviews" class="min-h-screen max-w-7xl mx-auto p-4 py-10">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto p-4">
    <div class="head">
      <h1
        class="bg-gradient-to-l from-secondary to-primary bg-clip-text text-transparent"
      >
        Reviews
      </h1>
      <p class="text-muted text-center text-xl mt-2">What people are saying about our collaboration.</p>
    </div>

    <div
      class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mt-12"
    >
      <!-- Review 1 -->
      <div
        class="review-card bg-neutral-900/40 border border-neutral-800 p-8 rounded-2xl flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-primary/30 transition-colors duration-300"
      >
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex text-primary text-sm gap-1">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i>
          </div>
          <p
            class="text-muted font-montserrat leading-relaxed italic"
          >
            “ Thank you for building this system with such care, and for the
            trust you showed under unique circumstances. Your cooperation
            and clear project scoping stood out and helped us avoid
            potential future mistakes. We look forward to putting the system
            into production with confidence. ”
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-8 flex items-center gap-4">
          <div
            class="size-12 rounded-full bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center text-primary font-bold font-iceberg text-xl"
          >
            LC
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-bold font-iceberg text-foreground text-base">
              Lucieta Christine
            </h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-muted-dark font-montserrat">
              PM, Stratera
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Review 2 -->
      <div
        class="review-card bg-neutral-900/40 border border-neutral-800 p-8 rounded-2xl flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-primary/30 transition-colors duration-300"
      >
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex text-primary text-sm gap-1">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i>
          </div>
          <p
            class="text-muted font-montserrat leading-relaxed italic"
          >
            “ Thank you for translating our brand into a clean, modern
            website. You really paid attention to the visuals and how
            information is presented, and the end result feels professional,
            fast, and easy for clients to understand. We look forward to
            continue working together. ”
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-8 flex items-center gap-4">
          <div
            class="size-12 rounded-full bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center text-primary font-bold font-iceberg text-xl"
          >
            EN
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-bold font-iceberg text-foreground text-base">
              Elinah Naeku
            </h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-muted-dark font-montserrat">
              CEO, Sprint Kenya
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Review 3 -->
      <div
        class="review-card bg-neutral-900/40 border border-neutral-800 p-8 rounded-2xl flex flex-col justify-between hover:border-primary/30 transition-colors duration-300"
      >
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div class="flex text-primary text-sm gap-1">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i>
            <i class="fa-solid fa-star"></i>
          </div>
          <p
            class="text-muted font-montserrat leading-relaxed italic"
          >
            “ Thank you for taking on a complex operational problem and
            turning it into a usable app. You really thought through how
            different roles work across branches, and the app made
            day-to-day tracking much easier for our team. ”
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-8 flex items-center gap-4">
          <div
            class="size-12 rounded-full bg-primary/10 flex items-center justify-center text-primary font-bold font-iceberg text-xl"
          >
            NM
          </div>
          <div>
            <h4 class="font-bold font-iceberg text-foreground text-base">
              Nicholus Maina
            </h4>
            <p class="text-xs text-muted-dark font-montserrat">
              Business Owner
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
